# redoxfs: the RedoxFS server, its host tool and the vendored library it serves.
#
# Milestone 611 (every program and crate belongs to a package). The package's name, kind, home
# and membership are provisional, the lane's proposal for calef to ratify; the format is
# helpers/packages.py's header, and notes/package-boundaries.md has the table and the reasons.

name redoxfs
kind optional
home undecided the server and host tool are ours and the library is Redox's; whether the port goes upstream is open

crate redoxfs_server
crate redoxfs_host
crate redoxfs

path vendor/redoxfs.divergence.patch
path vendor/redoxfs.pin
